The title of my presentation today is Enforcing Safety at Runtime for
Systems with Disturbances, and this work was advised by Dr. Sam Coogan.

3
00:00:17,806 --> 00:00:28,292
这项工作的初衷是控制系统的安全性。控制系统的安全性问题通常被表述为不变性约束，
即要求系统在所有时间内都保持在某些安全的运行条件集合内。
This work is motivated by control system safety, and the safety problem for control systems is often posed as an invariance
constraint, requiring that the system remain in some safe set of operating conditions for all time.

4
00:00:29,774 --> 00:00:35,812
某些控制器可以预先验证安全性，也就是说，验证它们能为某个不变集提供安全的子状态空间。
Certain controllers can be verified safe a priori, that is, verify that they render a safe subset of states for an invariant.

5
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:43,236
然而，在并非如此的情况下，通过使用运行时保证机制来在线强制执行安全性是理想的选择。
However, when this is not the case, it can be desirable to enforce safety online through the use of a runtime assurance mechanism.

6
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:55,680
运行时保证机制有时也被称为主动集不变性滤波器，它会在线过滤所需的控制信号，
以便平衡性能目标与安全性目标（例如不变性约束）。
A runtime assurance mechanism, which is sometimes also called an active set invariance filter,
will filter a desired control signal online in order to balance performance goals with safety goals, such as invariance constraints.

